a text called early is "abc".
a text called later is "b".
If early is later then, Print "unexpected: two different texts are equal".
If early is not later then, Print "abc is not b".
a list called short is [1].
a list called long is [1, 2].
If short's length is less than long's length then, Print "the short list has fewer elements".
a buffer called note is "hi".
a buffer called echo is "hi".
If note is echo then, Print "two buffers holding hi are equal".
